#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: cb-10-the-long-answer
number: 510
name: The Long Answer
description: An Anchor walks at you one tile a round with Husks behind it. Collide something into it to Stagger it, then spend the Stagger — the pit at its back is four correct decisions away.
design: Combat Manoeuvre 10 — the whole chain.
design: One pit, on the far edge behind the enemy line, and no spikes. It is the last step of a four-step answer, not the first: an Anchor only reaches it while Staggered.
retired: Duplicates `hz-06` on Stagger and `cb-04` on the Anchor; its pit is explicitly optional, which makes it an easter egg rather than a question.

spawn n = Anchor
spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  ...O.h.BB
  ....h..BB
  ...n.....
  .l.....HH
  .........
  AA.......
  AA...h...
